fe in Mulmaster”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Jean_Rabe\" title=\"Jean Rabe\">Jean Rabe</a> ed. <a href=\"/wiki/Polyhedron_64\" title=\"Polyhedron 64\"><i>Polyhedron</i> #64</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 21.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260517065036\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.150 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2970/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11036/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5126/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5631/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  115.078      1 -total\n 50.44%   58.041      1 Template:Location\n 27.48%   31.618      1 Template:Refs\n 15.29%   17.599      1 Template:Pronounce\n  9.51%   10.949      3 Template:GetIPASyllable\n  7.29%    8.387      5 Template:Cite_book\n  6.42%    7.383      6 Template:Cite_publication\n  5.31%    6.107      1 Template:Cite_book/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_2nd_edition_(revised)/A_Grand_Tour_of_the_Realms\n  4.10%    4.713      7 Template:GetFirstPhoneme\n  3.03%    3.491      1 Template:Cite_polyhedron/64/The_Everwinking_Eye:_Daily_Life_in_Mulmaster\n-->\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.8_prod_forgottenrealms:pcache:idhash:23162-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260517065036 and revision id 955551. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","error":null,"source":{"wiki":"forgottenrealms.fandom.com","url":"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&format=json&prop=text&page=Reddansyr","fetchedAt":"2026-05-17T07:01:50Z"}}